# <type>(<scope>): <简体中文主题（不超过 72 字符，末尾不加句号）>
#
# 可选正文：说明修改动机、影响范围与设计权衡。
#
# 可选脚注：Closes #123 / BREAKING CHANGE: ...
#
# type 可选值：feat | fix | docs | refactor | perf | style | test | build | ci | chore | revert
# scope 示例：core | engine | player | potplayer | vlc | libvlc | seek | overlay | ui | docs | scripts | package
# 规范详情：docs/engineering/git-commit-convention.md
